<title>USA: Dupont Co Q3 net sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Dupont Co Q3 net sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Dollars in millions,	   Third Quarter	Nine Months</p>
<p>  except per share)		1996     1995     1996    1995</p>
<p> SALES			     $10,486 $10,200  $32,403 $31,778</p>
<p> Other Income			  328     220    1,103     805</p>
<p>     Total			  10,814  10,420   33,506  32,583</p>
<p> NET INCOME			    898     769    2,778   2,666</p>
<p> EARNINGS PER SHARE		 1.60    1.38     4.95    4.47</p>
<p>NOTES: Earnings per share are calculated on the basis of the following average number of common shares outstanding:</p>
<p>			  Third Quarter	   Nine Months</p>
<p>     1996	     561,367,436	     559,880,456</p>
<p>     1995	     554,978,850	     595,129,571</p>
<p>1996 Q3 net includes charge of $47 million, or $0.08/shr, for Benlate recall, which also resulted in 9 mth charges of $110 million vs $63 million.</p>
<p>1995 Q3 includes charges, gains netting a $2 million charge.</p>
<p>1996 9 mths also includes charges of $118 million and gains totaling $99 million.</p>
<p>1995 9 mths also includes gains of $34 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
